<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14370" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄποψις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>outlook, view,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεδίον πλῆθος ἄπειρον ἐς
			ἄποψιν</span> boundless in <i>view,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.204
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραπλησίους πάντας ἐκ τῆς
			ἀ.</span> all alike <i>to look at,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				11.31.8
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ἀπόψει εἶναι,
			γίγνεσθαι,</span> to be <i>within view,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				6.1.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.412
			</span></i>(<i><span class="en">
				Phld.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>lofty spot</i> or <i>tower which commands a view, belvedere,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				17.1.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
			</span></i><i>Comp. Cim.Luc.</i><i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>that on which one looks, view, prospect,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mir.</u>
				843a17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.133b
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
